# Cloud sync (OPTIONAL). Copy this file to `.env` for local dev, and set the same
# two variables in your Vercel project (Settings → Environment Variables) for prod.
#
# Leave them unset and the app runs fully local-first: progress saves to the browser,
# and every sign-in / sync control hides itself. Set both and accounts + cross-device
# cloud sync light up automatically — no code change, just a rebuild.
#
# Get these from the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings → API.
#  - URL is your project URL, e.g. https://abcdefgh.supabase.co
#  - Use the PUBLISHABLE (anon) key, never the service_role/secret key. It is safe to
#    ship in client code because row-level security guards the data (see supabase/migrations).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
